### Send custom anfertigung request email via Brevo
POST http://localhost:3000/api/request/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestType": "custom-request",
  "submittedAt": "2026-05-17T12:05:00.000Z",
  "source": "website-calculator",
  "serviceLabel": "Möbelanfertigung",
  "date": "2026-06-01",
  "timeWindow": "morning",
  "address": "Musterstraße 1, 47051 Duisburg",
  "notes": "Einbauschrank nach Maß, ca. 2,4 m breit.",
  "customer": {
    "firstName": "Erika",
    "lastName": "Mustermann",
    "phone": "+491701234567",
    "address": "Musterstraße 1, 47051 Duisburg"
  }
}
